<title>USA: TABLE-Transmontaigne Oil FY 97 net income up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Transmontaigne Oil FY 97 net income up.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransMontaigne Oil</p>
<p>						 For the Fiscal Years</p>
<p>						   Ended 30 April</p>
<p>						     1997	     1996</p>
<p> Revenue				    $1,166,665	 533,107</p>
<p> Net operating margin (1)		   21,344	  12,717</p>
<p> Operating income				9,901	   6,549</p>
<p> Net earnings				    9,171	   4,618</p>
<p> Earnings per common share		     .41	     .31</p>
<p> Weighted average common shares	   22,501	  15,130</p>
<p>			(000s, except per share data)</p>
<p>(1) Net operating margin represents revenues less product costs and direct operating expenses.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1700</p>
</text>
